s, such as U.S. treasury debt securities, U.S. Government-sponsored enterprise debt securities, bank subordinated debt, and FDIC-insured certificates of deposit; and equity investments, corporate bonds, CRA investments, and federal home loan bank stock, as well as bank-owned life insurance. Hingham Institution for Savings was incorporated in 1834 and is headquartered in Hingham, Massachusetts."}}